{"id":"wb-4-97","name":"晋城二仙庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"晋城二仙庙","text":"晋城二仙庙，又称小南村二仙庙，位于山西省晋城市泽州县金村镇小南村，是山西地区保存宋代木构建筑、彩塑与小木作的重要实例。二仙庙创建于北宋，历经金元明清四代修葺，现存正殿为北宋遗构。二仙庙内主要祭祀晋东南地方信仰中的二仙信仰，庙内供奉着乐氏二姐妹冲惠、冲淑二真人。\n1996年被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%99%8B%E5%9F%8E%E4%BA%8C%E4%BB%99%E5%BA%99","revisionId":95121048,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95121048","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8f1c93c531e8e2ed85cb8772.jpg","title":"20250906_Erxian_Temple,_Xiaonancun_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250906_Erxian_Temple,_Xiaonancun_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/80/20250906_Erxian_Temple%2C_Xiaonancun_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​小南村二仙庙","width":320,"height":213}}